raph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy mode, which is perfect for those new to the genre</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/9e12ed79866aff3ba0d738b1c9c17c52.webp?t=1759284503\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/b93ce32d9ca64b50c29a166c4c26a619.apng?t=1759284503\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/b93ce32d9ca64b50c29a166c4c26a619.poster.avif?t=1759284503\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/c825cc0db37b4fe015480b8c2c68c1d9.avif?t=1759284503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras_big/c825cc0db37b4fe015480b8c2c68c1d9.avif?t=1759284503 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At the edge of the earth lies a floating island inhabited by <strong>dragons</strong> called <strong>Mallow.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/ba6349e16f379648514dbe0e819a27b6.poster.avif?t=1759284503\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337840/extras/ba6349e16f379648514dbe0e819a27b6.webm?t=1759284503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph